# Arithmetic in counted and while loops.
total is 0
count from 1 to 200000 as n
    doubled is n times 2
    total is total plus doubled
.
say total
outer is 0
steps is 0
while outer is less than 300
    inner is 0
    while inner is less than 300
        steps is steps plus 1
        inner is inner plus 1
    .
    outer is outer plus 1
.
say steps
